{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PY2mNBGXXC3Qtc49129gAF","type":"tool_result","content":"receipt || creator/sign commands write explicit receipt paths; validate is read-only || Usage: taskspec receipt validate|sign|engine|environment|evaluation|graded|human ...\ndecompose || Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation. || Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\ndecompose init || Create explicit intent workspace. || Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\ndecompose prepare || Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it. || Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\ndecompose review || Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. || Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose compile || Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. || Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\ndecompose status || none || Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose impact || none || Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose import || Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required. || Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\nreceipt operational || Validate or import operational evidence without upgrading its trust. || Usage: taskspec receipt operational validate <file> | import <file> --out <path>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9aa51949-e1ca-4b77-8ee3-efab86480a5c","uuid":"24bf0f13-b9b6-4149-8087-f678f501ead1","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:18:52.908Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"receipt || creator/sign commands write explicit receipt paths; validate is read-only || Usage: taskspec receipt validate|sign|engine|environment|evaluation|graded|human ...\ndecompose || Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation. || Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\ndecompose init || Create explicit intent workspace. || Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\ndecompose prepare || Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it. || Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\ndecompose review || Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. || Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose compile || Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. || Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\ndecompose status || none || Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose impact || none || Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose import || Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required. || Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\nreceipt operational || Validate or import operational evidence without upgrading its trust. || Usage: taskspec receipt operational validate <file> | import <file> --out <path>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
